Stylist: the detected indentation could contain a line continuation or be empty when the
indent token spans `\t\\\n\x0c`; only the whitespace after the last formfeed/line break counts.
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-codegen-indentation-detection.py (ruff_parse_idempotency).

